abstract: "Fully autonomous agentic research. A complex matrix subspace annihilated by an unextendible family of product functionals doubles the minimum rank of every tensor partner, and the Tiles bound entangled state has Schmidt number exactly 2^N in N copies. Lean proofs are included. Dev D. Goyal is responsible for publication. No expert validation or peer review is claimed."
